# Copy this file to .env and define only secrets referenced by models.json.
# The program does not read fixed JEV_* configuration variables. Each route
# declares api_key_env in models.json, and the named environment variable holds
# the secret. Keep every endpoint, tier, policy, and gateway runtime setting in
# models.json.

# Run jev setup or use the local dashboard to configure the management key.
# Add provider credentials when configuring providers.
